# Stop app servers when finished

When editing and adjusting are done, stop every app server you started in this session — frontend, backend, or both.

- Tear down `next dev`, API servers, workers, and similar processes you launched.
- Do not leave them running in the background after the task is complete.
- Do not stop servers the user started themselves unless they asked you to.

```text
# ❌ BAD: finish the feature and leave `npm run dev` running
# ✅ GOOD: after verification, stop the processes you started (their PIDs / terminal sessions)
```
